Ladybird gives a ShadowRoot the nodeName of any DocumentFragment,
“#document-fragment”, as the DOM spec’s nodeName steps require. All
three engines do the same: Blink’s and WebKit’s ShadowRoot inherit
DocumentFragment::nodeName(), which returns “#document-fragment”, and
Gecko’s DocumentFragment, ShadowRoot included, asserts that its node
info carries nsGkAtoms::documentFragmentNodeName.
